WEBVTT

00:02:58.549 --> 00:03:00.843
Like the "no sweets before dinner" rule.

00:03:00.885 --> 00:03:04.430
Or wearing overalls
to a corporate board meeting.

00:03:05.431 --> 00:03:10.728
Or simply daring to defy the expectations
of the people around us.

00:03:11.896 --> 00:03:13.064
Now, as a kid,

00:03:13.064 --> 00:03:15.816
breaking the rules usually
only got us in trouble, right?

00:03:16.234 --> 00:03:18.986
But as adults, it's a different story.

00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:23.282
Breaking the rules, pushing boundaries,

00:03:23.324 --> 00:03:26.035
challenging the norm,

00:03:26.077 --> 00:03:28.788
asking why, why not?

00:03:28.829 --> 00:03:30.790
It does something to us.